  new List<String>{'rck-car-setup-1-0','RC: Calibrating the esc throttle (1/10 scale RC car or truck)','Cars & Trucks / Setup & Getting Started: calibrating the ESC throttle. Step-by-step guidance for 1/10 scale models.','<h2>Calibrating the esc throttle</h2><p>Applies to 1/10 scale RC car or truck models. Category: Cars &amp; Trucks. Problem type: Setup &amp; Getting Started.</p><ol><li>Turn the transmitter on first with throttle trims neutral.</li><li>Enter ESC calibration per the manual.</li><li>Register full throttle, full brake, and neutral, then power cycle.</li></ol>','Cars & Trucks','Setup & Getting Started'},
