  new List<String>{'rck-car-setup-2-0','RC: Setting steering dual rate and trim for a first drive (1/10 scale RC car or truck)','Cars & Trucks / Setup & Getting Started: setting steering dual rate and trim for a first drive. Step-by-step guidance for 1/10 scale models.','<h2>Setting steering dual rate and trim for a first drive</h2><p>Applies to 1/10 scale RC car or truck models. Category: Cars &amp; Trucks. Problem type: Setup &amp; Getting Started.</p><ol><li>Center the steering trim so the wheels point straight.</li><li>Reduce steering dual rate to about 70% for a gentler response.</li><li>Add a little expo to soften center steering.</li></ol>','Cars & Trucks','Setup & Getting Started'},
