  new List<String>{'rck-car-setup-4-0','RC: Break-in and first-run checklist (1/10 scale RC car or truck)','Cars & Trucks / Setup & Getting Started: break-in and first-run checklist. Step-by-step guidance for 1/10 scale models.','<h2>Break-in and first-run checklist</h2><p>Applies to 1/10 scale RC car or truck models. Category: Cars &amp; Trucks. Problem type: Setup &amp; Getting Started.</p><ol><li>Check all screws and wheel nuts are tight.</li><li>Confirm steering and throttle respond correctly and are not reversed.</li><li>Do a slow first run and listen for binding or rubbing.</li></ol>','Cars & Trucks','Setup & Getting Started'},
