  new List<String>{'rck-car-broken-0-0','RC: Grinding noise and a stripped spur gear (1/10 scale RC car or truck)','Cars & Trucks / Something Is Broken: grinding noise and a stripped spur gear. Step-by-step guidance for 1/10 scale models.','<h2>Grinding noise and a stripped spur gear</h2><p>Applies to 1/10 scale RC car or truck models. Category: Cars &amp; Trucks. Problem type: Something Is Broken.</p><ol><li>Inspect the spur and pinion for rounded teeth.</li><li>Replace the stripped gear and reset the mesh with the paper method.</li><li>Verify the motor screws are tight so mesh stays correct.</li></ol>','Cars & Trucks','Something Is Broken'},
